menu-item-3447\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3420.html\">후원 방법</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3117\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D603.html\">협력상담사</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4499\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4496.html\">협력단체</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3112\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2872.html\">자주 묻는 질문</a></li>\n<li class=\"lang-item lang-item-72 lang-item-en no-translation lang-item-first menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-5635-en\"><a href=\"#/page?file=en%2Findex.html\" hreflang=\"en-CA\" lang=\"en-CA\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"English\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>  </header>\n<!-- = Page banner area start = \\-->\n<section class=\"grop-banner-area grop-page_banner_height-200 \" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/4_banner_event.jpg&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center center; background-size: cover; background-attachment: ;\">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"grop-full_height  container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"grop-vertical_middle  text-uppercase  grop-page_title\">행사 | Events</h2>\n\t</div>\n\t<!--banner overly start\\-->\n\t<div class=\"grop-page_banr_overly_opc-30\"></div><!--/banner overly end-->\n</section>\n<section id=\"tribe-events-pg-template\" class=\"tribe-events-pg-template\" role=\"main\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"일정표 불러오는 중\" loading=\"lazy\"></span>\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<p class=\"tribe-events-back\">\n\t\t<a href=\"#/page?file=events-list%2Findex.html\"> « 전체 이벤트</a>\n\t</p>\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">청소년 자녀를 둔 부모 성장 레시피 (2기) | Workshop for Parents development</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\n\t\t<h2><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">2021-06-28@7:00 오후</span>-<span class=\"tribe-event-date-end\">2021-07-26@10:00 오후</span></h2>\t</div>\n\n\t<!-- Event header -->\n\t<div id=\"tribe-events-header\" data-title=\"청소년 자녀를 둔 부모 성장 레시피 (2기) - 러브 토론토 (Love Toronto)\" data-viewtitle=\"청소년 자녀를 둔 부모 성장 레시피 (2기)\">\n\t\t<!-- Navigation -->\n\t\t<nav class=\"tribe-events-nav-pagination\" aria-label=\"이벤트 네비게이션\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-sub-nav\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-previous\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4399.html\"><span>«</span> 이전</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-next\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4410.html\">다음 <span>»</span></a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-sub-nav -->\n\t\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- #tribe-events-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-4403\" class=\"post-4403 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\t\t\t<!-- Event featured image, but exclude link -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-event-image\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"1440\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8%EC%84%B1%EC%9E%A5%EB%A0%88%EC%8B%9C%ED%94%BC%ED%8F%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%84%B020210628.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t\t<!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Love Family 에서 오는 6월 28일부터 진행하는 온라인 부모 교육 프로그램 (부모 성장 레시피)을 진행합니다.<br>\n‘부모 성장 레시피’ 프로그램은 청소년기 자녀를 둔 부모들을 대상으로 하는 전문 강사들의 강의외에도 여러가지 엑티비티와 소그룹 활동들을 통해 ‘부모들이 함께 자신의 경험을 공유하고 문제해결을 위한 방법을 찾아가며, 지지와 격려를 통해 양육 자신감을 고취시키는 것’을 목적으로 만들어진 프로그램입니다.</p>\n<p>– 제목 : 청소년 자녀를 둔 부모교육 프로그램 ‘부모 성장 레시피’<br>\n– 내용 : 청소년 문화/ 발달 특성/정신건강/대화/가족 역동 등 강의와 엑티비티<br>\n– 일정 : 6월 28일(월) 부터 5주간 저녁 7시-10시<br>\n– 진행 : Zoom 을 이용한 실시간 강의 및 그룹 토의/ Activity / Q&amp;A 등<br>\n– 문의 : 김인철(647-880-9891(text message), chrisickim@gmail.com)<br>\n– 신청 : https://forms.gle/HBAdTWeqKJimRQs46</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events tribe-common\">\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-common-c-btn-border tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--cal-export tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__export-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 23 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\t<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M.128.896V16.13c0 .211.145.383.323.383h15.354c.179 0 .323-.172.323-.383V.896c0-.212-.144-.383-.323-.383H.451C.273.513.128.684.128.896Zm16 6.742h-.901V4.679H1.009v10.729h14.218v-3.336h.901V7.638ZM1.01 1.614h14.218v2.058H1.009V1.614Z\"></path>\n\t<path d=\"M20.5 9.846H8.312M18.524 6.953l2.89 2.909-2.855 2.855\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-text\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tribe-events-subscribe-dropdown-content\" aria-label=\"캘린더에 이벤트를 추가하기 위한 링크 보기\">\n\t\t\t\t\t캘린더에 추가하기\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--caret-down tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 7\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\t<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M1.008.609L5 4.6 8.992.61l.958.958L5 6.517.05